==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Astral Radiance|Eevee|119}} from the {{TCG|Astral Radiance}} expansion.
*This card's shiny rare print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Eevee}}.
*'''Find a Friend''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Great Encounters|Togepi|88}} from the {{TCG|Great Encounters}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

